### name: rel.record-projection.last-value-first-position
--- source
LIST(1) .> MAP(RECORD("x", 1, "middle", 2, "x", 9, "X", 3))
--- expect
tree -{"1"=-{"x"=t"9", "middle"=t"2", "X"=t"3"}}
===

### name: rel.record-projection.overwritten-error
--- source
LIST(1) .> MAP(RECORD("x", 1 / 0, "x", 9))
--- expect
error E_DIV_ZERO
===

### name: rel.record-projection.overwritten-missing-field
--- source
LIST(RECORD("id", 1)) .> MAP(RECORD("x", _["missing"], "x", 9))
--- expect
error E_NO_KEY
===

### name: rel.record-projection.bucket-duplicates
--- source
LIST(1, 1) .> BUCKET(_, RECORD("x", _K, "middle", 2, "x", COUNT(_)))
--- expect
tree -{"1"=-{"x"=t"2", "middle"=t"2"}}
===

### name: rel.record-projection.group-key-duplicates
--- source
LIST(1, 2) .> BUCKET(RECORD("x", _, "x", 0), COUNT(_))
--- expect
tree -{"1"=t"2"}
===
